# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Why: the repo's committed blobs are already LF, but Windows checkouts were
# producing CRLF working trees. That made every tracked file show as modified
# (~8,100 insertions / 8,100 deletions across 39 files) and buried real changes
# in line-ending noise. Pinning eol=lf keeps Windows, WSL, and CI in agreement.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
